                        "entry_id": "0ff0fcbf-ca62-358c-a24b-7fccdadc2c23",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An Ashkenazi Jewish surname."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1fee20d1-3023-46e6-9531-6864005c31df",
                                "sense_id": "aa560b79-169b-3b05-973b-f99dd2188794",
                                "text": "At that time S.M. Lazar, editor in Cracow of the new Hebrew nespaper, Ha-Miṣpeh, had accused Hurwitz and his editor, Yosef Klausner, of anarchism, sacrilege, and “missionizing.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
